# Postfix transport map — routes offsystem.fr straight to Mailu through
# the WireGuard mail-relay tunnel instead of doing normal MX/DNS lookups.
# Brackets around the host disable MX resolution: connect directly to
# that IP:port. 10.100.1.3 is the tunnel address of the "home" peer
# (migrated from the dev machine, 10.100.1.2, to the mini PC on
# 2026-08-24 — see ../../wireguard-mail-relay/README.md), where
# scripts/mailu-portforward-setup.sh keeps port 25 forwarded to
# svc/mailu-front inside the cluster.
#
# Applied on the VPS with: postmap /etc/postfix/transport
offsystem.fr    smtp:[10.100.1.3]:25
